      "versionNonce": 2042940126,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773558521459,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Description: `Make edits to a text file.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Description: `Make edits to a text file.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "e2NoF2EsxzN6zXTzZ6tBK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 703.7503182561263,
      "y": 477.819642902688,
      "width": 762.37939453125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "an",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1272607106,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 166222338,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773558521459,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Supports multiple edits per file. Each edit replaces 'old_str' with 'new_str'. By\ndefault, each replacement applies to the first exact match found in the file.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Supports multiple edits per file. Each edit replaces 'old_str' with 'new_str'. By default, each replacement applies to the first exact match found in the file.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "e2ecDCrxg0rTMulZSLpQE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 688.0603768498763,
      "y": 560.319642902688,
      "width": 793.75927734375,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ao",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1247862686,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 719568670,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773558521459,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "If no exact match is found, the system falls back to a line-by-line fuzzy match\nthat compares lines using normalized whitespace. Original indentation is preserved\nwhere possible.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "If no exact match is found, the system falls back to a line-by-line fuzzy match that compares lines using normalized whitespace. Original indentation is preserved where possible.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QBU3N6QDyMuds7-xEKoan",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 699.7903878362044,
      "y": 692.819642902688,
      "width": 770.2992553710938,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ap",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 810873154,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 898746818,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773558521459,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "If the file doesn't exist, it will be created with the 'new_str' of the first edit\n(only if 'old_str' is empty).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "If the file doesn't exist, it will be created with the 'new_str' of the first edit (only if 'old_str' is empty).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "IfaqVFARwyq0vhcrsidV2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 697.2203194768294,
      "y": 787.819642902688,
      "width": 775.4393920898438,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aq",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1621048286,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 2090478430,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773558521459,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "If dryRun is true, the file won't be changed, but a unified diff of the proposed\nresult will be returned.`,",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "If dryRun is true, the file won't be changed, but a unified diff of the proposed result will be returned.`,",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
